BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 467.65 Tm (hammers the same point on the batch resubmission window, which has been cut) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 452.42 Tm (to 4 business days: "Do not miss this particular change because you will expire) Tj ET
