BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 300.17 Tm (rejection [g3C-DoM_9CI @ 00:03:53].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 284.95 Tm (Plans and TPAs report their own bleeding points. Brian O'Hara describes one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 269.72 Tm (claim split into 15 disputes, one per CPT code, spread across seven or eight) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 254.50 Tm (IDREs with mixed outcomes: "Some IDREs have dismissed disputes, some are) Tj ET
